T* () Tj
T* (LED1, yellow \(EXT PWR\): external power is present \(USB-C, 12 V barrel or DB9\).) Tj
T* (LED3, green \(ON\): the rocker is on and the system is powered.) Tj
T* (LED4, red \(CHG\): the battery is charging.) Tj
T* (LED2, green \(FULL\): charging is finished. A flicker with no battery connected is normal.) Tj
